{"4123800": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Road", "steam_appid": 4123800, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A co-op horror road trip where your car is your only lifeline. Drive with friends to abandoned locations, grab what you can, and escape before creatures, anomalies, or your own bad decisions leave you stranded.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123800/extras/b1707475209f82fa54682f4f74cd5a51.webp?t=1781149259\" width=920 height=42 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123800/extras/c1aba2f8fdee400858d822bdaff4db4b.poster.avif?t=1781149259\" width=780 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123800/extras/c1aba2f8fdee400858d822bdaff4db4b.webm?t=1781149259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123800/extras/c1aba2f8fdee400858d822bdaff4db4b.mp4?t=1781149259\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operating out of run-down motels, you and your friends have been selected for the finest Artefact Recovery Program. Work together to keep your car in good repair as you drive to and explore dangerous locations. Load your car with stolen goods and race to the nearest motel to drop-off the haul and collect your reward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way you’ll explore derelict cinemas, forgotten summer camps, the occasional condemned industrial site, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123800/extras/56e73700e4d30a727ea099342cbbb2bf.webp?t=1781149259\" width=920 height=42 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123800/extras/d2ce2235540d2ed7b3116cd512664b8e.poster.avif?t=1781149259\" width=780 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123800/extras/d2ce2235540d2ed7b3116cd512664b8e.webm?t=1781149259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123800/extras/d2ce2235540d2ed7b3116cd512664b8e.mp4?t=1781149259\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inside each building are valuables you’ll want to find, and hazards best to avoid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Successful artefact recoveries mean payment and more lucrative opportunities. Unsuccessful recoveries? Well we’ll take care of the paperwork and inform your emergency contact.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123800/extras/c9a713eedc7d56202d0b11113518ff35.webp?t=1781149259\" width=920 height=42 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123800/extras/2d96e2e43d6f1abef1a32824711e44a4.poster.avif?t=1781149259\" width=920 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123800/extras/2d96e2e43d6f1abef1a32824711e44a4.webm?t=1781149259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123800/extras/2d96e2e43d6f1abef1a32824711e44a4.mp4?t=1781149259\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your car to better survive against creatures and other road hazards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are ghosts causing you pain on the road? Equip a roof-mounted floodlight to vaporize them. Is your friend a reckless driver who keeps driving off cliffs? Attach a winch to pull your car back up. Just want to make your car look cool? Grab some spray cans and paint your car to perfection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123800/extras/870883293bad7b22a9fe924c86f8beac.webp?t=1781149259\" width=920 height=42 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123800/extras/683f7cb90b543c6d7417b8fa88f30f0a.poster.avif?t=1781149259\" width=780 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123800/extras/683f7cb90b543c6d7417b8fa88f30f0a.webm?t=1781149259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123800/extras/683f7cb90b543c6d7417b8fa88f30f0a.mp4?t=1781149259\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather your friends and form a crew of up to 5 for the ultimate road trip</strong>. Work together to upkeep your car and embark on dangerous missions, but don’t forget to enjoy the ride.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Communicate through proximity chat and walkie-talkies. Don't worry if you die, you can still chat with (or haunt) your friends through the car radio.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or as a crew of up to 5 players in online co-op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Large open world driving</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Communicate through proximity chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dead players can chat through the car’s radio</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and loot a range of unique locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 unique enemies + lots of road hazards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Car upgrades and cosmetics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A co-op horror road trip where your car is your only lifeline. Drive with friends to abandoned locations, grab what you can, and escape before creatures, anomalies, or your own bad decisions leave you stranded.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123800/extras/b1707475209f82fa54682f4f74cd5a51.webp?t=1781149259\" width=920 height=42 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123800/extras/c1aba2f8fdee400858d822bdaff4db4b.poster.avif?t=1781149259\" width=780 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123800/extras/c1aba2f8fdee400858d822bdaff4db4b.webm?t=1781149259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123800/extras/c1aba2f8fdee400858d822bdaff4db4b.mp4?t=1781149259\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operating out of run-down motels, you and your friends have been selected for the finest Artefact Recovery Program. Work together to keep your car in good repair as you drive to and explore dangerous locations. Load your car with stolen goods and race to the nearest motel to drop-off the haul and collect your reward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way you’ll explore derelict cinemas, forgotten summer camps, the occasional condemned industrial site, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123800/extras/56e73700e4d30a727ea099342cbbb2bf.webp?t=1781149259\" width=920 height=42 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123800/extras/d2ce2235540d2ed7b3116cd512664b8e.poster.avif?t=1781149259\" width=780 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123800/extras/d2ce2235540d2ed7b3116cd512664b8e.webm?t=1781149259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123800/extras/d2ce2235540d2ed7b3116cd512664b8e.mp4?t=1781149259\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inside each building are valuables you’ll want to find, and hazards best to avoid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Successful artefact recoveries mean payment and more lucrative opportunities. Unsuccessful recoveries? Well we’ll take care of the paperwork and inform your emergency contact.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123800/extras/c9a713eedc7d56202d0b11113518ff35.webp?t=1781149259\" width=920 height=42 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123800/extras/2d96e2e43d6f1abef1a32824711e44a4.poster.avif?t=1781149259\" width=920 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123800/extras/2d96e2e43d6f1abef1a32824711e44a4.webm?t=1781149259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123800/extras/2d96e2e43d6f1abef1a32824711e44a4.mp4?t=1781149259\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your car to better survive against creatures and other road hazards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are ghosts causing you pain on the road? Equip a roof-mounted floodlight to vaporize them. Is your friend a reckless driver who keeps driving off cliffs? Attach a winch to pull your car back up. Just want to make your car look cool? Grab some spray cans and paint your car to perfection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123800/extras/870883293bad7b22a9fe924c86f8beac.webp?t=1781149259\" width=920 height=42 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123800/extras/683f7cb90b543c6d7417b8fa88f30f0a.poster.avif?t=1781149259\" width=780 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123800/extras/683f7cb90b543c6d7417b8fa88f30f0a.webm?t=1781149259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123800/extras/683f7cb90b543c6d7417b8fa88f30f0a.mp4?t=1781149259\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather your friends and form a crew of up to 5 for the ultimate road trip</strong>. Work together to upkeep your car and embark on dangerous missions, but don’t forget to enjoy the ride.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Communicate through proximity chat and walkie-talkies. Don't worry if you die, you can still chat with (or haunt) your friends through the car radio.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or as a crew of up to 5 players in online co-op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Large open world driving</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Communicate through proximity chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dead players can chat through the car’s radio</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and loot a range of unique locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 unique enemies + lots of road hazards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Car upgrades and cosmetics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>", "short_description": "A co-op horror + driving game for up to 5 players. Explore an anomaly-ridden world, loot buildings for valuables, and drive for your life to escape the creatures that lurk.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Czech, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Traditional Chinese, Turkish, Ukrainian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123800/dea14b405541094cc23c383592c85dcee17a3f83/header.jpg?t=1781149259", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.stea